# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Reference 3D models — deliberately excluded (55 MB combined).
#
# These are trademarked production vehicles (Tesla Model 3, BYD Dolphin) and
# are NOT used by the site: the car in gowatt/src/three/Car.tsx is an original
# generic crossover built in code. Committing them would put 55 MB of unused
# binaries into git history permanently, where they cannot easily be removed.
#
# To include them anyway, delete the two lines below and commit. Consider
# `git lfs track "*.glb"` first.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
2021_byd_dolphin_ev.glb
tesla_2018_model_3.glb
